          "title": "You'll want to know: خمیر",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "خمیر (khamir) — \"dough\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "نانوا خمیر را روی میز پهن کرد. Nânvâ khamir râ ru-ye miz pahn kard. The baker spread the dough out on a table."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also any paste. Khamir-e nân \"bread dough\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "khamir is borrowed from Arabic khamīr, \"leavened dough\" (EtymDB)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
