              "text": "ورز دادن (varz dâdan) — \"to knead\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او خمیر را ده دقیقه ورز داد. U khamir râ dah daqiqe varz dâd. She kneaded the dough for ten minutes."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present varz midahad."
            }
          ]
        },
