              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ور آمدن (var âmadan) — \"to rise (of dough)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "خمیر (khamir) در جای گرم ور آمد. Khamir dar jâ-ye garm var âmad. The dough rose in a warm place."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Present var miâyad. Var is an old word for \"up\"."
            }
          ]
        },
